WEBVTT

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.160
Polar Bear's Café

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.450
Polar Bear's Café

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.990
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.890
Panda is no Longer a Panda.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:38.780
I'm not gonna be a panda 
anymore after tomorrow.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:40.510
Hold on...

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:42.210
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.490
What do you mean?

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:44.860
I'm saying,

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:46.500
that I won't be a panda anymore.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.710
Oh?

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:52.260
Is this something we can just ignore?

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.920
Then what are you going to be?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.310
Something other than a panda.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.390
I don't think pandas can be 
anything other than pandas.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.460
Of course I can.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.000
I requested a change in position.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:07.030
Change in position?

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.020
Notice: 
Part-time Panda is 
hereby reassigned 
to the Badger Corner. 
-Zoo Director

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.860
"Notice:

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.910
Part-time Panda is hereby 
reassigned to the Badger Corner.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.260
-Zoo Director."

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.700
Panda's going to the Badger Corner?

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:27.170
I wonder what in the world 
the director is thinking.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:31.020
Hello, I've just been reassigned here.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.040
My name is Panda.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.140
It's a pleasure to work with you.

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:38.230
What? You've become a badger?

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:40.510
There was a decree put forth.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.390
I see.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:46.810
Well, pandas do share some traits
with nocturnal animals.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.670
Let's not talk about difficult things.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.570
I'll do my best as a badger!

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.270
Then let's dig a hole together.

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:56.780
Okay!

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:01.320
Huh?

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:06.330
He's sleeping...

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:11.300
Hey, Panda, wake up!

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.300
Oh, Mr. Handa.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.670
Good morning.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.210
Hey, Mr. Handa.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:22.580
All Panda's been doing is sleeping,

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.800
so I don't feel that he's 
serious about being a badger.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.980
I wonder if it's because I don't have

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:29.200
any intention to be one.

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:32.270
But you requested the 
reassignment, didn't you?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.510
But it's so dark in here.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.320
A panda that's not out in the sun

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.780
isn't a panda at all.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.360
I know!

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:44.220
I'll ask to be reassigned 
to somewhere else.

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:48.400
There's no way they're 
going to approve that.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.040
Notice: 
Part-time Panda is 
hereby reassigned 
to the Otter Corner. 
-Zoo Director

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.000
It was approved...

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.700
An otter now?

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.820
Hello, I've been reassigned here.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:02.930
My name is Panda.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.760
Pleasure to work with you.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.690
You better do your best.

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:10.060
It's not easy being an otter.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.810
All right, I guess you'd better hop in.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.100
I'll just stand here and watch.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.000
What are you talking about?

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.410
Otters have to be in the water.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.240
Why don't you try breaking this open?

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.330
This is important.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:33.000
If you can't open a clam, 
you can't be an otter.

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:34.500
I see.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.210
Here, watch.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.490
Now you try it.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.700
It's not opening.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.850
You have to put more strength into it.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:55.930
I can't do it.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:58.600
What are you talking about? Try harder.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.410
But my tummy hurts.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.530
So does mine.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.610
Oh, I know!

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:08.780
Let me break it on your stomach.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.000
No self-respecting otter would ask another

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.780
to break a clam on their stomach.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.290
Oh, Mr. Handa.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.300
What is it?

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.380
This newbie is no good.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:25.340
Well, pandas don't break open 
clams in the first place.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.090
I'd do it if it was my job, though.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.470
But you haven't.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:32.620
I won't be able to be 
an otter, Mr. Handa.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:36.190
But you requested the 
reassignment, didn't you?

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.900
Notice: 
Part-time Panda is 
hereby reassigned 
to the Llama Corner. 
-Zoo Director

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.760
This time it's a llama?

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.250
Come on, Mom! Let's go!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.230
Yes, yes.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.800
Um...

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.680
Why am I here?

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:58.000
Well, I can't be a llama without 
someone to help me.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.710
But I have my other duties to attend to.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:04.210
Being a llama is an important job, too.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.150
All right.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.030
But I can't see anything 
and it's hard to breathe.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.060
Do you want to trade places, then?

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.590
I don't think there's a point 
to me being up front.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.290
I guess the front
is better for me.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.760
Hello, Panda.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.970
Oh, hey, Mr. Llama.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.750
Pleasure to work with you.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.830
Same here.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:39.370
Hey, I should probably do 
something llama-like, huh?

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.830
No, I think you're fine.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.540
Why?

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.290
Well, I don't think anyone 
will be looking.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.750
Everyone goes right over to the 
Giraffe Corner next door.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.450
It's a giraffe!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.200
Its neck is so long!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.150
It's so big!

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:03.090
See?

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:05.920
How's it going?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.650
Are you pulling off being a llama?

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.860
Oh, Mr. Handa.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:15.300
I don't think there's much of a point in me being here.

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:16.700
What?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.080
Notice: 
Part-time Panda is 
hereby a zoo keeper. 
-Zoo Director

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.350
What?!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:29.090
Now he's a zoo keeper?

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:33.510
Is it even possible for a 
panda to be a zoo keeper?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.810
Mr. Handa, Kirino,

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:41.480
let's all do our best 
and work hard today!

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.920
I wonder if Panda is 
actually working...

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.490
Huh?

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:56.380
Uh...

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.650
Hello.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.720
This is the petting zoo.

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:13.150
I don't really understand,

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.240
so please call back later.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.010
Bye.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:27.900
Bamboo Thi

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:27.900
We have both an indoor bath as well as an outdoor bath that you can enjoy any season. Each bath is open 24 hours. Dinner is European style cuisine mixed with Japanese flavor...

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.980
Wow, this hot spring looks great.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.570
I wonder where it is?

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.890
What are you doing, Panda?

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:32.540
Oh, good timing.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:36.820
Hey, do you know where this place is?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.990
That's my seat.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.290
Oh, don't worry, Mr. Handa.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:48.630
I put all your stuff in 
a box right over there.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.520
Hey! Don't move my stuff 
around without permission!

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:56.240
Or rather, what are you doing here

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.330
while everyone else is doing your job?

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.720
Desk work!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:03.030
Whew, I'm so busy.

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:06.180
Hanging up on people and 
being on the computer.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:08.190
Hanging up on people...

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.540
You're not working at all.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.160
Hey, Panda.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.620
What?

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:23.300
A zookeeper shouldn't eat
the animals' food.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:25.910
I've been thinking...

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:29.480
I don't think it's 
possible for an animal

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.850
to take care of other animals.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:34.310
You can't keep complaining like that.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.790
There's nowhere else you 
can be reassigned to.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.760
What?

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:43.220
Then I guess I'll just have 
to be the zoo director.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.120
Zoo director?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.940
Let's do whatever we can to 
stop that from happening.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:53.860
I wonder if Mr. Full-time 
Panda is doing his job.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.990
Oh, hello there, Panda.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.100
What are you doing, Mr. Llama?

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.660
I asked to be reassigned.

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:08.080
So the Zoo Director reassigned 
Mr. Llama to the Panda Corner?

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.380
Hey, Llama.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.520
We're about to get a group of people,

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.200
so don't forget about the service.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.660
Okay, understood.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.840
So cute!

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.270
So cool!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:27.760
They're so great!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.940
Mr. Llama is doing rather 
well, isn't he?

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.520
It appears so.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.260
Service, service.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.530
Service, service.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.990
Service, service.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.980
Wow, you're doing great.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.460
Service, service.

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.900
I think you're a great panda.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.800
Service, service.

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:47.330
You shine so much brighter 
than you do as a llama.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.440
Really?

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:54.030
Service, service!

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.790
Service, service!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.880
Service, service!

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.880
You're doing great.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.420
Service, service!

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.110
You were truly meant for this.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.060
Service, service!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.850
Notice: 
Part-time Panda is 
hereby reassigned 
to the Panda Corner. 
-Zoo Director

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:09.090
"Part-time Panda is hereby 
reassigned to the Panda Corner."

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:15.920
Looks like Panda had himself 
put back where he started.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:26.950
Looks like being a panda 
is meant for me.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:30.740
Hey, Mr. Llama.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:33.130
Here's your lunch for the day.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.090
Thank you very much.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.860
I'll be cleaning in the afternoon.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:39.570
Mr. Handa.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:41.300
What is it?

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:50.010
I wonder if I'll get 
another reassignment.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:52.730
What...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:12:03.450
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:08.870
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:08.030
Mei Mei's Prince!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.620
Panda

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:16.020
Hey, Big Brother.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.760
What is it, Mei Mei?

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.700
I went to the zoo

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.280
that you work at yesterday.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.180
And there...

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.270
I saw this really good-looking guy!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.510
What? Does he work at the zoo?

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:35.320
Do you know him?

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:38.710
I can't recall any good-looking guys.

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:41.560
I saw him near the Panda Corner.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.570
Oh, maybe it was Kirino.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:48.190
Well, he's sort of good-looking.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.540
So his name is Mr. Kirino?

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:53.120
Him, right?

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.170
What? No.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.260
He's way better looking than that.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.200
Huh?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.460
Oh!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.840
Don't tell me it's Rin Rin.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.360
Don't go near that guy.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.230
He's a total loser.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:11.270
I know who Rin Rin is.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.340
He's the florist, right?

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:14.810
That's not him either!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:15.730
What?

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:18.590
Then I have no idea.

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:23.220
He spoke nicely to me 
and gave me some bamboo.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.470
My heart was beating so fast!

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:27.410
You can't be talking about...

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.120
...him?

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.620
Yeah! That's totally him!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.480
He's so hot!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.370
My prince!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.880
Prince? Mr. Handa?

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.760
His name is Mr. Handa?

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.770
How wonderful.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:47.180
Do you want me to tell Mr. Handa

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:50.850
that my little sister is 
calling him her prince?

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.490
What?

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:57.350
Well, it's not like I want to 
be his girlfriend or anything.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:01.270
I just want to keep him in my heart.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:04.210
Even that's enough to choke me up.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.400
Really?

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.320
Well, he's so good-looking.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.030
He's really popular, right?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:13.510
We're talking about Mr. Handa, right?

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.170
Of course!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:19.540
Who else would be the extremely 
popular, good-looking prince?

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:23.460
So, what kind of person is Prince Han?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.220
I wonder what he likes.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.560
Prince Han?

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:29.690
I'll write down what I want to ask,

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.140
so you can go ask for me, Big Brother.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.140
Uh...

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:43.110
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.320
Mr. Handa, Mr. Handa!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.820
What is it, Panda?

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.450
Panda

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.880
I'm home!

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:54.830
Oh, Big Brother!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.370
Did you ask him?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.310
First, his favorite food...

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.210
Yes?

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:06.110
The very end of an omelette.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.430
My, he's so refined!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.460
Prince Han is so amazing!

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.260
And then?

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:17.770
Let's see...

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.060
He said it wasn't really a hobby,

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.730
but he likes 
collecting smooth rocks.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.230
Such a sophisticated hobby!

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.520
Prince Han is so cool!

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:31.830
Cool?

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:32.990
And, and?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.960
On his days off...

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:39.290
He does laundry...

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.790
He cleans...

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:51.800
and he folds used shopping bags 
into neat, little triangles.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.890
How domestic!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.270
Prince Han is so amazing!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:00.620
The more I find out about him,

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.940
the more wonderful Prince Han is!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.440
Mei Mei,

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.820
eat some bamboo grass and calm down.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:10.160
You just don't get it at all, Big Brother.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:10.970
Oh!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:13.870
Did you take a picture of Prince Han?

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.780
What? No, I didn't.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.200
Why not?!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.960
I have no interest in having 
pictures of Mr. Handa.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.250
Go take some.

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:27.250
Go take tons of pictures 
of Prince Han being cool!

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:30.960
Mr. Handa, Mr. Handa.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.430
What is it, Panda?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.260
Panda

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.450
Yeah! He's so hot!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:45.770
What?!

00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:49.570
What about him makes you think that?

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:52.570
His round face...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.530
His chubby build...

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:58.180
Not to mention his legs are short.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.180
What? That's what you like?

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.990
He's so great!

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:04.270
He's just like a panda!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.130
Oh...

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:12.650
My little sister says that 
Prince Han looks just like a panda.

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:15.340
What? Who's Prince Han?

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.660
It's Mr. Handa.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.310
She says he's really good-looking.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:24.160
Wow, Mr. Handa is quite popular.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:29.390
Mr. Handa is beyond hope.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.830
But my little sister keeps 
calling him Prince Han.

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:37.210
If your little sister and 
Mr. Handa were to marry,

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:40.330
you'd be Mr. Handa's 
older brother, Panda.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:44.750
I'd be Mr. Handa's older brother?

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.040
<i>Here's your breakfast bamboo, Big Brother.</i>

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:50.880
<i>Big Brother, here is your lunch bamboo.</i>

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.510
<i>Here's your after-meal 
bamboo, Big Brother.</i>

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.650
<i>Here's your midnight snack 
bamboo, Big Brother.</i>

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:00.250
I'd be really full.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.420
What are you talking about?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:10.940
I wonder if Mr. Handa would 
get along with my mom.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.490
<i>Hi, Mom. I'm Handa.</i>

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:17.950
<i>Seconds on bamboo, please!</i>

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:22.950
<i>Don't suck me up!</i>

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.740
They say that the groom's relationship

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:28.090
with his mother-in-law can be difficult.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.510
Oh, it's Mr. Handa.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:37.640
Maybe this place would be good?

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.510
I think that one is good, too.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:43.130
It's a perfect place for newlyweds.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:44.230
What?!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:48.500
Oh, did you hear that? 
She said "newlyweds."

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:52.690
<i>Mr. Handa is getting 
married to Ms. Badger?</i>

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.390
So smooth.

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:01.700
Such a perfect triangle.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:06.010
<i>I can't tell Mei Mei!</i>

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.620
Panda

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:10.620
Hey, Big Brother.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:13.810
Was Prince Han amazing today, too?

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:14.770
What?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:18.040
I-I'm not sure.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:21.510
What? But I was looking forward 
to hearing all about it.

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:25.890
See? My Prince Han diary.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.410
I write in it every day.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.150
I see...

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.630
What did you write?

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:32.580
No!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.150
Don't look inside.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.610
You'll be invading a lady's privacy.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.720
I didn't even look...

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:43.150
Maybe I'll secretly go to the zoo.

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:44.200
What?

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:48.100
And I'll secretly watch over 
him from the shadows.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.290
<i>Such a nice day.</i>

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.190
<i>Let's go home together.</i>

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:00.670
No. You'll see a side of Mr. Handa
 he doesn't want you to see.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.000
A side he doesn't want me to see?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.470
Anyway, you shouldn't go.

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:07.620
How disappointing.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:11.410
<i>There's no way I can tell Mei Mei.</i>

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.220
Oh, Mr. Handa!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:20.160
Congratulations!

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:20.860
Huh?

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:22.930
You two look great together.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:23.570
Huh?

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:26.200
You're getting married

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.780
to Ms. Badger, right?

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.390
What?!

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:32.310
Panda!

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.130
Oh, Mr. Handa.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.500
Congratulations.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.810
You're creating problems,

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.510
telling everyone that Ms. Badger 
and I are getting married!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.110
About that...

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:45.690
You should at least let 
me know before you do it.

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:48.120
It's rather shocking when it's so sudden.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:50.890
I want to know what made you think that!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:55.810
I heard you and Ms. Badger were 
looking for a new home together.

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:59.470
Ms. Badger was looking 
for a new place to stay,

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:01.280
so I was there to be her co-signer!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.530
Huh?

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.070
Oh, really?

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:08.910
Panda

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.480
Coming!

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.880
Hi, good evening.

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:15.210
My name is Handa.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:18.880
Panda fell asleep and wouldn't wake up.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.130
There we go.

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:25.910
Well, I'll be going now.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:26.800
Oh!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.280
Um...

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:29.560
Yes?

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:32.280
W-Would you like some tea?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.860
Thank you for the offer.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:38.540
But the light bulb in
 my bathroom burned out,

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:40.600
so I have to pick up a new one.

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:42.700
The store by my house closes at 9 PM.

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:44.990
If you'll excuse me.

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:54.340
Prince Han is so observant on 
top of being so responsible!

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:56.340
Big Brother would never think of

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:59.290
buying light bulbs to replace a light.

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:03.960
Huh? I'm home?

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:06.520
Big Brother, did you hear?!

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.180
Huh? What?

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:11.950
Prince Han said the store closes at 9 PM!

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:14.480
He's so amazing!

00:22:13.070 --> 00:22:14.480
Really?

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:19.850
Prince Han said he had to 
get to the store by 9 PM.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:23.400
I don't think you need to write that.

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:24.480
Next Time

00:23:58.140 --> 00:23:59.790
Mr. Penguin, Mr. Penguin.

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:01.790
What is it, Polar Bear, 
all of a sudden?

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:03.490
I wanted to try that once.

00:24:03.490 --> 00:24:05.340
Okay, you can start now.

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:07.130
Mr. Penguin, Mr. Penguin.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:08.190
What is it, Panda?

00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:09.800
What is it, Polar Bear?

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:12.610
Sorry, sorry. I wanted 
to try that once.

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:13.530
Go ahead.

00:24:13.530 --> 00:24:15.250
Mr. Penguin, Mr. Penguin.

00:24:15.250 --> 00:24:16.440
What is it, Panda?

00:24:16.440 --> 00:24:17.240
Let's end it.

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:17.930
Jeez...

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:19.820
Next week's Polar Bear's Café

00:24:19.820 --> 00:24:21.310
will air the following week.

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:22.410
It's going to air next week!

00:24:21.350 --> 00:24:24.480
Sales Penguin 

00:24:22.410 --> 00:24:24.530
Enjoy!
